Will AI replace all the jobs?
@klarnaseb the CEO of @Klarna thinks "AI can already do all of the jobs that we, as humans, do."
My take: Executives tend to overestimate how much AI can automate in the near term, though more tasks will be automated as AI becomes more powerful.

