@DigEconLab @erikbryn @LinkedIn @AnthropicAI @PeterMcCrory Stanford @DigEconLab Director @ErikBryn explains that the future of AI and the labor landscape is not a prediction question, but rather a design question.
"We now have more powerful tools than ever before, so we need to think about how we can use those tools intentionally."
